    "research": true,
    "physics": "Large units are built to order in a small number of plants, and order backlogs have grown to several years of revenue. Deliverable capacity by rating is not published. In the EU there was no shortage of electrical steel in total tonnage in 2025; the highest grades come from imports and are not measured separately.",
